igrated_image.png", "id": "158781045249213", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386310_920035758102908_8823418622052401152_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RzR_XypYglwQ7kNvwFYhHVe&_nc_oc=Adp174imwuRm6stSRQgOHfqhmiN81GrBMHTSmrOvLKs9hElAEB3yymc-8LevySGFeOg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP_nJus-IgZYOsE9OGVn_cSxSXFagxxe6W_cTanaHfl6A&oe=6ACA4BBF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "TTORiNG Adventure:Mr. Breson's keepsake", "keywords": ["adventure", "puzzle", "voicerecognition", "ttoring", "microworld"], "long_description": "TTORiNG Adventure is a voice recognition based interactive animation. The story progresses through the user directly engaging in conversations with characters in an imaginary world. Consequently, there is a high level of immersion and the player can actively participate in the story. There is also the benefit of cognitive development through a story with a concept of deductive reasoning as well as logic, observational, analytical and the application of other skills. Also there are many interesting features including numerous puzzles and a \u201cmicro world\u201d experience. Through this, players can genuine and fun experience that can only be had in virtual reality.", "short_description": "TTORiNG Adventure is a voice recognition based interactive animation. The story progresses through the user directly engaging in conversations with characters in an imaginary world. Consequently, there is a high level of immersion and the player can actively participate in the story. Also there are many interesting features including numerous puzzles and a \u201cmicro world\u201d experience. Through this, players can genuine and fun experience that can only be had in virtual reality."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.vrotein.co.kr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.vrotein.co.kr/", "publisher_name